  "job_B3.4.8_20251003_114750": {
    "text": "Men \u00f0a leofestan, \u00fe\u00e6s myclan domd\u00e6ges worc bi\u00f0 swi\u00f0e egeslic & andryslic eallum gesceaftum.\nIn \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fea hleo\u00f0riendan ligeas forb\u00e6rna\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6ne blodgemengdan geard & \u00fea \u00fee nu her syndon on\n& on \u00feam d\u00e6ge gewit sunnan leoht & monan leoht & \u00fea leoht ealra tungla.\n& on \u00feam d\u00e6ge bi\u00f0 dryhtnes rod blode flowende betweox wolcnum, & in \u00feam d\u00e6ge bi\u00f0 dryhtnes onsyn\nIn \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fea synfullan heofia\u00fe & wepa\u00fe, for \u00fean hie \u00e6r noldon hira synna betan, ac hie sarige\nIn \u00feam d\u00e6ge beo\u00f0 blawende \u00fea byman of IIII sceattum \u00feyses middangeardes, & \u00feonne ealle arisa\u00fe, swa\nOn \u00feam d\u00e6ge site\u00f0 ure dryhten in his \u00feam myclan m\u00e6gen\u00ferymme & his onsyne \u00e6tywe\u00f0 & his\n& \u00feonne Iudeas magon geseon \u00feone \u00fee hie \u00e6r cwealdon & hengon.\n& se so\u00f0f\u00e6sta dema \u00feonne deme\u00f0 ealra manna gehwylcum \u00e6fter his sylfes gewyrhtum.\nHw\u00e6t, \u00feonne \u00feince\u00f0 \u00feam synfullan \u00fe\u00e6t noht ne sie \u00fe\u00e6s hates ne \u00fe\u00e6s cealdes, ne \u00fe\u00e6s heardes ne \u00fe\u00e6s\nHw\u00e6t la, \u00fe\u00e6t is ofer eal gemet to sceawigenne & to sm\u00e6genne, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea earman fyrenfullan sculon sarige\nEala hw\u00e6t, manna mod syndon earmlice a\u00feristode \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00e6fre l\u00e6tan sculon \u00fe\u00e6t dea\u00feberende dioful\nLa hw\u00e6t, men him eallinga ne ondr\u00e6da\u00fe hu \u00fe\u00e6t dioful him onst\u00e6le\u00f0 ealle \u00fea unrihtan weorc \u00fee her\nLa hw\u00e6t, men him ne ondr\u00e6da\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t mycle dioful Antecrist mid his helle witum & mid his yrm\u00feum &\nLa hw\u00e6t, we us ne ondr\u00e6da\u00fe \u00feone toweardan ege domesd\u00e6ges, se is yrm\u00fea d\u00e6g & earfo\u00f0a d\u00e6g &\nOn \u00feam d\u00e6ge us bi\u00f0 \u00e6teowed se opena heofon & engla \u00ferym & eallwihtna hryre & eor\u00fean forwyrht,\n& \u00feonne bi\u00f0 us \u00e6ghwylc \u00feyllic egesa \u00e6teowed.\n\u00de\u00e6r \u00fea fyrenfullan \u00feonne meahton gewiscan \u00fe\u00e6t hie n\u00e6fre ne w\u00e6ren acennede fram hiora f\u00e6drum &\nHw\u00e6t, him \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6re leofre \u00feonne eal middangeard mid gestreonum \u00fee heofon behwylfe\u00f0.\nLa \u00fe\u00e6t we us ne ondr\u00e6da\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t we d\u00e6ghwamlice geseo\u00f0 beforan urum eagum, nu we \u00feam o\u00f0rum ne\nHw\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne, la, bi\u00f0 sarlic sar & earmlic gedal \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman & \u00fe\u00e6re sawle, gif \u00feonne se earma\nAc utan we beon gemyndige ussa sawla \u00feearfe, & wyrcen we god on \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fee we \u00f0urhteon\nAc lufigen we urne dryhten mid ealle mode & m\u00e6gene & mid eallre usse heortan & hygdo, mid ealre\nLufigen we usse \u00fea nehstan swa swa us sylfe, & sin we mildheorte earmum mannum & el\u00feeodegum &\nOnd \u00feeah ure hwylc wi\u00f0 o\u00f0erne gegylte on worde o\u00f0\u00f0e on worce, forbere he him \u00fe\u00e6t li\u00f0elice, \u00fee l\u00e6s\nSwa sylfa cw\u00e6\u00f0: Dimittite & dimittetur uobis.\nGe\u00ferowigen we for ures dryhtnes lufan eall \u00fe\u00e6t us man to earfe\u00f0nessum gedoo her on worulde.\nHw\u00e6t, we behofiga\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we gemunen hu mycel he for us ge\u00ferowode, \u00e6fter \u00fean \u00fee he menniscum\nSwa se witiga cw\u00e6\u00f0: Dryhten \u00fea geh\u00e6le\u00f0 & hafa\u00fe on heofona rice \u00fea \u00fee her on worulde beo\u00f0 ea\u00f0mode\nHw\u00e6t, we gehyra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea beo\u00f0 for Gode eadige & welige \u00fea \u00fee on worulde bio\u00f0 ea\u00f0mode &\nHw\u00e6t, we \u00feonne magon be \u00feam witan & ongitan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea beo\u00f0 for Gode earme & unl\u00e6de \u00fea \u00fee her on\nEallra synna sio is Gode la\u00feost & ungecwemost, for \u00fean \u00fee mancynn \u00e6rest \u00feurh \u00fea \u00e6feste w\u00e6ron on\nLa hw\u00e6t, we behofiga\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t we usse earan ontynen & usse heortan to \u00feam godspellican larum \u00fee us\nHw\u00e6t, we nu on idlum gilpe us mid golde & mid gimmum gearwia\u00fe, & blissia\u00fe & gl\u00e6dmode beo\u00f0 swa\nH\u00e6bben we gode hreowe ura synna.\n\u00deeah \u00fe\u00e6t gelimpe \u00fe\u00e6t ure hwylc wi\u00f0 o\u00f0erne gesynnige on worde o\u00f0\u00f0e on worce, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feonne bot bi\u00f0\nFor \u00fean ne bi\u00f0 n\u00e6fre se man to \u00fean swi\u00f0e synful \u00fe\u00e6t him symle ne sie sio bot alyfedu.\nUtan we nu for \u00fean efstan to Gode, \u00e6r \u00fean us se dea\u00f0 gegripe, for \u00fean he us swi\u00f0e to neal\u00e6ce\u00f0.\n& sien we snotre & so\u00f0f\u00e6ste & mildheorte & rummode & rihtwise & \u00e6lmesgeorne & cl\u00e6nheorte &\n& he us \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6s to leane forgife\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ece rice \u00fe\u00e6t us \u00e6t frym\u00fee geteohod w\u00e6s.\nUtan we nu efstan to \u00fean, \u00fea hwile \u00fee we ura wega wealdan moton.\n\u00de\u00e6r hie n\u00e6fre leofe gedala\u00fe ne la\u00fee gesamnia\u00fe, ne n\u00e6fre d\u00e6g ne cyme\u00f0 \u00e6fter d\u00e6ge ne niht \u00e6fter\nAc \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 ece leoht & blis & ece wuldor & ece gefea mid urum dryhtne, middangeardes alysende,",
